<tr><td><a href="StructureDefinition-LMOrderInformationCz.html">duvodObjednavky</a></td><td>A.2.2 - Reason for the request</td><td>related</td><td>Composition ({{ include.composition }})</td><td>section[clinicalIndication]</td><td></td><td>Document presentation of the indication and question. Slice notation is not literal FHIRPath.</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="StructureDefinition-LMOrderInformationCz.html">duvodObjednavky.problem</a></td><td>A.2.2.1 - Indication diagnosis</td><td>equivalent</td><td>ServiceRequest ({{ include.serviceRequest }})</td><td>reasonCode</td><td>Composition ({{ include.composition }}).section[orderInformation].entry.resolve()</td><td>Transfer the complete CodeableConcept. Coding slices distinguish mkn-10, snomed and orphacode systems, not diagnosis and reason roles.</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="StructureDefinition-LMOrderInformationCz.html">duvodObjednavky.problem</a></td><td>A.2.2.1 - Indication diagnosis by reference</td><td>equivalent</td><td><a href="https://hl7.cz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-condition-cz-core.html">Condition (CZ_ConditionCore)</a></td><td>code</td><td>Composition ({{ include.composition }}).section[orderInformation].entry.resolve().reasonReference.resolve()</td><td>Alternative to reasonCode when a corresponding Condition exists. Reuse the same instance.</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="StructureDefinition-LMOrderInformationCz.html">duvodObjednavky.klinickaOtazkaKod</a></td><td>A.2.2.2 - Coded clinical question</td><td>equivalent</td><td><a href="StructureDefinition-cz-clinicalQuestion.html">Condition (CZ_ClinicalQuestion)</a></td><td>code</td><td>Composition ({{ include.composition }}).section[clinicalIndication].entry.resolve()</td><td>Optional code.coding has a required binding to http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/condition-code as in IMG-Order. code.text is required.</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="StructureDefinition-LMOrderInformationCz.html">duvodObjednavky.klinickaOtazkaText</a></td><td>A.2.2.3 - Narrative clinical question</td><td>related</td><td>Composition ({{ include.composition }})</td><td>section[clinicalIndication].text</td><td></td><td>Convert the question to XHTML narrative. A question that does not describe a condition need not create a Condition resource.</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="StructureDefinition-LMOrderInformationCz.html">duvodObjednavky.klinickaOtazkaText</a></td><td>A.2.2.3 - Text of a structured clinical question</td><td>related</td><td><a href="StructureDefinition-cz-clinicalQuestion.html">Condition (CZ_ClinicalQuestion)</a></td><td>code.text</td><td>Composition ({{ include.composition }}).section[clinicalIndication].entry.resolve()</td><td>When the clinical problem is represented as Condition, its text is required and must agree with the section narrative. A question alone does not establish a diagnosis.</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="StructureDefinition-LMOrderInformationCz.html">duvodObjednavky.duvodKod</a></td><td>A.2.2.4 - Coded reason for the order</td><td>equivalent</td><td>ServiceRequest ({{ include.serviceRequest }})</td><td>reasonCode</td><td>Composition ({{ include.composition }}).section[orderInformation].entry.resolve()</td><td>Transfer the complete CodeableConcept. No reasonCode.coding[reason] slice is defined.</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="StructureDefinition-LMOrderInformationCz.html">duvodObjednavky.duvodText</a></td><td>A.2.2.5 - Narrative reason for the order</td><td>equivalent</td><td>ServiceRequest ({{ include.serviceRequest }})</td><td>reasonCode.text</td><td>Composition ({{ include.composition }}).section[orderInformation].entry.resolve()</td><td>The service reason can also be summarized in clinicalIndication; it is distinct from the clinical question in A.2.2.3.</td></tr>
